        sentence: "The walls of the dirt foundation sloped up at a precise 34-degree angle."
      },
      {
        id: 12,
        word: "pile",
        pos: "noun",
        meaning: "a mass or heap of things laid on top of one another.",
        cantonese: "一堆／泥堆",
